# SKYWELL level 4, the Eye: no coin blocks and no star blocks, and the top
# is a single row of clouds while the Well Eye lives. The Eye fires small
# aimed shots; each hand fires spreads of five and drops lightning that
# breaks the platforms under it; in turn a fist sweeps low across the
# shaft, and the eye swoops across, letting out four minions. Once the eye
# is shut the ledge out comes in at the top.
game skywell
wait 5
press A
cheat keys 3
cheat level 4
expect count_5 == 0
expect count_4 == 0
expect top_type == 1
cheat god
cheat top 14
wait 2
expect boss_on == 1
expect boss_phase == 0
# a crate under the left hand is broken by its lightning
cheat clear
cheat plat 0 0 0 13
cheat plat 2 32 -40 2
expect count_2 == 1
wait 60
expect eshots >= 6
wait 50
expect boss_phase == 0
expect count_2 == 0
# the fist: down low at one side, then across the shaft
cheat boss_phase 1
wait 2
expect boss_phase == 1
wait 60
expect fist_dy > 100
expect fist_x < 40
wait 120
expect fist_x > 150
wait 70
expect boss_phase == 0
# the swoop: the eye dives and lets out its minions
cheat boss_phase 2
wait 2
expect boss_phase == 2
wait 128
expect eye_dy > 50
wait 80
expect minions >= 3
wait 60
expect boss_phase == 0
# shut the eye: the clouds at the top give way to the ledge out
cheat eye_hp 1
cheat clear
cheat plat 0 0 0 13
cheat pos 100 -12
hold UP+B 60
expect boss_dead == 1
expect top_type == 0
